## 1. Creating the Data Model for Categories

```kotlin:app/src/main/java/tungp/android/bazarbooks/data/model/Category.kt
package tungp.android.bazarbooks.data.model

data class Category(
 val id: String,
 val name: String,
 val description: String? = null,
